Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:04.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下昨晚抓来一个离家出走的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men brought in a runaway last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.81,0:00:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身上什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no I.D. On her … nothing on her, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一张离开内布拉斯加的大巴票\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for a bus ticket out of Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫艾莉克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着 是因为猎人训练好了警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive because hunters trained the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该说谢谢才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the first words out of your mouth should be a thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认为她是被吸血鬼抓走的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the vamps are the ones who took her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.65,0:00:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前见到过 吸血鬼把人当宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen it before …Vampires keeping people as pets,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.85,0:00:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当血袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}human feedbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你家人吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This your family? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我不是你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, I'm not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你对我说的第一句话 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were the first words you ever said to me. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在你身体里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to track somebody down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.85,0:00:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫艾米莉娅 她已经失踪多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name's Amelia. She's been missing for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 你不能过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, you are not going out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备拿克莱尔怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do about Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不取决于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我是乔迪·米尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean. Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪·米尔斯是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody Mills is good people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.09,0:00:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会给你个住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she'll give you a place to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:01:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你慢慢缓过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you get back on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔…你如果踏上我们走的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Claire, you go down this path … our path…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,干蠢事之前千万做好功课\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Do your homework before you do anything stupid, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果需要我们 我们随叫随到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're here if you need us, any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:12.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:18.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（南达科他州 苏福尔斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.41,0:01:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面冷清得都风滚草了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like tumbleweeds out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他们去冬季啪啪地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they moved on to their winter humping grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里好冷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想离开这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于能独处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We finally have the place to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,旁边的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the, uh, car next to you's.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上下晃动 还发出呻吟声吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}bumping up and down and you hear groaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能听到我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody can hear us, can they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.44,0:01:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.82,0:02:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.95,0:02:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第12集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我们找到案子了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you catch us a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人拍了张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some… some dude took a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只鼬鼠骑着一只飞行的啄木鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a weasel riding a flying woodpecker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.29,0:03:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞在半空中 真是疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midair. I-it's kind of nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么阿玛拉也没有消息喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm guessing there's nothing on the mar-meter, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始觉得上帝的疯子妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to think that God's psycho sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能转入地下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has gone to ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 小卡有消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? Hear from cas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他说他在想办法引她出洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he said he was working on something to draw her out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.17,0:03:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他离开后就一直没消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's been radio silence since he was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.09,0:03:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这么安静让我好不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all this quiet's starting to wig me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是 猫王\N{\fnArial\fs30}That? That's the Elvis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elvis?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.11,0:03:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糖衣甜甜圈 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a glazed doughnut. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:03:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面一个 下面一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One topside, one on the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,比较差劲的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, your inferior versions…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.61,0:04:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用一个甜甜圈 从中间切开\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll just take one doughnut, split it right down the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是好货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 希望你吃得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, uh, hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上还有孩子吃不饱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there are starving children out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.66,0:04:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我身经百战 没死在妖魔鬼怪手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I'm not gonna survive hundreds of monster attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不要死在双甜甜圈怪手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get flatlined by… by some double doughnut monstrosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是猫王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Elvis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西有多少卡路里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many calories are in that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:29.35,Title,0,0,0,0,,你的《疯狂高尔夫》影评早该出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your, uh, "Caddyshack" review is way overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没问题 我们就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you got it. We're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去趟南达科他州吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel about South Dakota?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,据传\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在站在王室旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that I'm in the presence of royalty…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会当选舞会国王和王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Future prom king and queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在领先\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are in the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 对你来说当然可能 但我怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, yeah, for you, Henry, but not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.65,0:05:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 这个还有人在做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, people still do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这都是80年代的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was, like, an '80s thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 还有王冠什么的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, there's crowns and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.35,0:05:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,得啦 我们好好享受一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's have fun with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿裙子 你穿西装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wear the dress. You wear the tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.17,0:05:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的胸可撑不起我的裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have the boobs for my dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 拜托 看我这对儿胸器\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Come on. Look at those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,P老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mr. P.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.01,0:05:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯 明天的测试准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, you ready for the test tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}So not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那幸好你还有18小时做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lucky you've got 18 hours to prep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.54,0:05:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回见 - 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See ya. - See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 化学实验课上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Chem lab…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在自己的口水里睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell asleep in a pool of my own drool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,教练说明天有两节的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and coach is calling double practice tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,中场需要好好练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midfield needs serious tightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的表现好棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,融入得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fitting right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.55,0:06:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又没亮蝙蝠灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't put up the bat signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下邻里不得安宁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there goes the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我帮帮你吧 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me help you out. - Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不客气 - 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, sure. - Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.47,0:06:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,太久没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊 真是太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, clearly, it's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯 是你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, Alex, that is you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没变化那么大吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't look that different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天早上在浴室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing what you can accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,待两小时 成效惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you spend two hours in the bathroom every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候还早起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when are you even up in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在居然醒着都是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised you're awake now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们俩赶来肯定不是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm pretty sure the guys didn't come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.07,0:06:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你们互相厮杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}to watch you two kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是不小心臀播了你们的电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't accidentally butt-dial you or anything, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.82,0:06:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我找了他们 是关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called about the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不肯相信是怪物的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you refuse to believe are monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们问过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you'd checked in with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.09,0:07:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能省了跑这趟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have saved you a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想着反正也该来看看你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we figured we owed you the visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我正需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what? Actually, I could use the backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.19,0:07:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再去烤一只鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go put another chicken on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们坐舒服点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You settle in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是再烤两只吧 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-might want to make it two. I'm…Just gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这鸡肉太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this bird is fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再搭配土豆和豆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you mix it up with the potatoes and the… the beans…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们每天都这么吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys eat like this every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是鸡肉而已啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且有鸡的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's shaped like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是肉饼或者鸡块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a patty or… or a nugget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能说案子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get to the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三个人失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three people are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有证据表明他们不是自己离镇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no evidence that they didn't skip town on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个是离家出走少年 一个流浪汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of them were runaways. One was a homeless guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后有人见到他是在布雷登口\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was last seen at Brayden Point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在盯梢那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been stalking it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多呢 布雷登口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty left. Brayden Point?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 孩子们去那儿亲热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's where the kids go to make out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 炉子上还剩四磅左右的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes, there's about four pounds left on the stove.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 外面有鬼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, there's something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.59,0:08:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说见到了他们从未见过的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are reporting animals they've never seen before,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西在他们前院逗留随后又消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}things stalking their front yards that disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…放回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is according to the… hey, put it back…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.89,0:08:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔在追的邻里犯罪博客上写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neighborhood crime blogs that Claire has been reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是目击者证词\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're eyewitness accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还办过证据更少的案子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've hunted on less.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔抓到过一个狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire did catch a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 其实是一只有狂犬病的德国牧羊犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right, it turned out to be a German shepherd with rabies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And before that was the vampire…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢色情cos的议员女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}councilwoman into erotic cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:08:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之前我都不知道cos是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know what cosplay was before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,警队丢尽了脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super-embarrassing for the whole force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没闲着啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是骚扰无辜之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.K.A., menacing innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔积攒了一堆袭人案底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire has a whole string of assaults racked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在没进监狱的唯一原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason she's not sitting in jail right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我是治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that I'm the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我出过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, I've been wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次肯定是有怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this time I know there's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能不说什么怪物 猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we stop talking about monsters and hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实生活呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我们说实在的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure. Let's get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和亨利选好周末了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Henry settle on a weekend yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算什么时候溜去乔迪的小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're sneaking out to Jody's cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱搞啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}to screw yourselves silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're completely insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好先清空你的谷歌聊天再跟他搞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to clear your g-chats before you commit to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这似乎是家务事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This seems like, uh, family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.71,0:09:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit! Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯 你有什么想说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, anything you want to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.91,0:09:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, well, um, I-I may have…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你背包里的避孕药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've definitely seen birth control pills in your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.31,0:10:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要说这个了啊 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, we're going there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这事不能说 那就更不该做了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, if we can't talk about it, we shouldn't be doing it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm not gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太小还不能做爱 对你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you are too young to be having sex, or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要跟谁做爱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's she gonna have sex with?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都不跟任何人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't talk to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,避孕药是无法防止性病传播的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that birth control pills are useless against STDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你跟谁做 每次都要戴套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you are with needs to suit up every time, always.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能提早拉起吊桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pulling up the drawbridge early.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且别指望男人 不管我多喜欢亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't expect the guy, as much as I love Henry,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.11,0:10:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会带着套套来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to always show up packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 我们还什么都没做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! We haven't done anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是 想备着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just… trying to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还需要土豆泥 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need some more mashed potatoes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,土豆泥 我去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mashed pota… I'm just gonna… I'm gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去再拿点土豆泥来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get some more potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,土豆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po-ta-toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.01,0:11:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好个埋伏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice ambush in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们不告而来在先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys crashed my pad first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得知道 有怪物我们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, thought we were gonna be helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,避孕你得自己教\N{\fnArial\fs30}with monsters, not birth control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会 我很爱她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, don't get me wrong, I love those girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真是在勉强支撑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, man, I am hanging on by my fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个被克莱尔当成怪物的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last guy Claire pegged as a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她拿剑架在了他脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}she held a sword to his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一心想提出指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is hell-bent on pressing charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是艾莉克斯会适应不来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was gonna be Alex with the, uh, adjustment issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她也有过艰难时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, it was rough going there for a bit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今年一切都顺利起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this year, everything clicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还跟学校里最受欢迎的男生约会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dating the most popular guy in school, for gosh sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我都要认不出她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I barely recognized her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算这样 我觉得我该教她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even there, I feel like I should be teaching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,男友和恋爱的一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}about boyfriends and relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一个妈妈该教女儿的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, stuff a mom would teach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和我当年如果有人教就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy and I could have benefited from a little of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.37,0:12:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但我不是艾莉克斯的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I'm not Alex's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是克莱尔的妈妈 我没有养大她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Claire's mom. I didn't raise them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟她们没有那样的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have that kind of history with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会跟克莱尔谈的 让她安顿下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk to Claire, and we'll get her to settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔的问题不止是打人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just Claire busting heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.57,0:12:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她开始上大学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she started college,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.97,0:12:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她好几周没去上课\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she hasn't been to classes for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她成天去找案子 阅读传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She spends all her time trolling for cases and reading lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么一说感觉好恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds kind of creepy when you put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不反对猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've got nothing against hunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果她是借此逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if she's hiding in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她没有别的可做 那我就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}because she doesn't have anything else, I'm just…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她那么独来独往我很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried about her being so alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让萨姆去开导她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll put Sammy on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他更擅长跟人谈心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's better with the whole talky thing, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢啦 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh… you got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.18,0:13:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你我在装潢方面意见一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you and I have the same decorating philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不需要往墙上贴贾斯汀·比伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I need the Biebs on my wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想明天我们可以去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking tomorrow we could go to the families.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些失踪者的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the people who disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们之间是否有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, like, see if there's any connection between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那事 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that, Claire…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how it can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎魔会吞噬你的生活 而不是朝九晚五\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hunter life consumes you. There's no 9:00-to-5:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对一切都草木皆兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start seeing monsters at every quik mart in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.96,0:13:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我是疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think I'm nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我并不确定真有案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying is I'm not sure you have a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而最近 你似乎一直在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lately, it seems like you've spent a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不存在的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunting monsters that weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't be the first hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,想逃避的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was trying to escape something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我在逃避什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what am I escaping, exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了令人麻痹的无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}aside from mind-numbing boredom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟乔迪和艾莉克斯处得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how are things with Jody and Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有在选边站\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not taking sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.93,0:14:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想理解现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们并不是有意让我难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not trying to make me feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯倒是 她讨厌我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Alex is. She hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我就是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes I just feel like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入乔迪和艾莉克斯太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little late to the Jody and Alex show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们一起经历了一些很艰辛的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they have been through some heavy crap together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该自己出去闯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time I just head out on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个全职猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be a full-fledged hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我能理解想猎魔的心理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, I absolutely understand the need to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:14:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但怪物是不会被消灭干净的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the monsters are always going to be there,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远没有穷尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}on and on, forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但组建家庭 上学的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a chance at a family, a home, school…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了可能就没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.48,0:15:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我们要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:15:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我们要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:15:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在测试之前跟P老师谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to catch Mr. P. before the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.82,0:16:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,被害人是史蒂芬·菲尔普斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Victim's name is Stephen Phelps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.39,0:16:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,数学老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a math teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯最喜欢的老师了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex's favorite, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔普斯被倒挂在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phelps was found hanging upside-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,旗杆顶端 用胶带绑在了上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the top of the flagpole, duct-taped…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,脖子似乎先被人折断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like his neck had been snapped first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有目击者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any witnesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有有幸发现了他的管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the lucky custodian that found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手怎么把菲尔普斯弄上去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how did the killer get Phelps up there in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他自己有消防车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless he had his own fire truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 难道凶手背着个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so our killer climbs up 20 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬了20英尺 然后用胶带把他绑在了上面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a guy on his back and then duct-tapes him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 而且为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.68,0:16:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在旗杆旁发现了这个 不知有没有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found this around the flagpole if it means anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经把样本送去实验室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already sent a sample to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.51,0:17:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对菲尔普斯还有什么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do you know about Phelps?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只知道他是个好老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just that he was a damn fine teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的帮了艾莉克斯很多 这我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really helped Alex out. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. So, what are we dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恶魔 鬼魂附体 - 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Demons? Ghost possession? - Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是犯罪现场 你不能进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a crime scene. You can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那假联调局就行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but the fake FBI can?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小点声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your voice down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想办案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to work the case…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.38,0:17:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都说不存在的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the case everyone said wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what? You were right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面是有点鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something unnatural going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.43,0:17:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能走到一群警官面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't just walk up in front of a bunch of officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.93,0:17:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求治安官向你透露\N{\fnArial\fs30}and demand that the sheriff give you details.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶案调查的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a murder investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能谈尸体的问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk about the body now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没说完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm not even near finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得对乔迪放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to show Jody a little respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.04,0:17:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她接纳你是帮了大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did you a huge solid by taking you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她帮你找了学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got you set up at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人喜欢上学 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wants to go to school, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那可是学校啊 - 就是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's school. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 她为了让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point is she's been busting her ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,过上正常生活忙里忙外\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get you set up with a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给你饭吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's feeding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的房间现在比我的还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you got a nicer room than I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:17:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让你不用蹲监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She kept you out of jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又没让她那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never asked her to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.59,0:18:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得有点感恩的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to act like you give a crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得知道感激她为你做的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to appreciate what that woman's do…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校停课了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They canceled school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就去…别处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're gonna… hang out, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.87,0:18:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,去别处啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.65,0:18:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他肯定明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. He got the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you go…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么都走了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}People walking away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.80,0:18:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还认识联调局的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是乔迪认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody does.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔普斯老师最近跟谁闹过矛盾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there anyone that Mr. Phelps had run-ins with recently…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,教职工 家长 学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staff, parents, students?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.37,0:18:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not that I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,家长还给他烤巧克力蛋糕呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parents would bake brownies for that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们需要找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay, well, we're gonna want to, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,教职工和学生谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}interview staff and students,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要人事档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as have access to personnel records.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要抓到那混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to catch that bastard…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他里子翻出来 吊起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn his insides out and string him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你这么支持我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you're on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早上去升旗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I raise the flag in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就看到他被绑在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, he's… he's s-stuck up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,像只棍子上的虫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, like a bug on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.19,0:19:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一开始还以为是恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was a prank at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是绑了个假人什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, you know, like it was a dummy or something like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识菲尔普斯老师吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know Mr. Phelps?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校最近有发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you noticed anything weird or out of the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪 不寻常的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}going on at the school lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.38,0:19:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指比老师被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean weirder than a dead teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用胶带绑在旗杆上还怪的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}taped to the top of a flagpole or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现菲尔普斯老师之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you discovered Mr. Phelps,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有察觉任何奇怪的景象 声音或气味吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}had you noticed any unusual sights or sounds or smells?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一直臭臭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I mean, you know, this place kind of always stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.78,0:20:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子可邋遢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids are slobs, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.89,0:20:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我只能尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do the best that I can, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,维勒先生 你今早见到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Weiler, you don't seem too upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样恐怖的景象 可你似乎没怎么受影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the, uh, graphic scene you came upon this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, what can I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I-I didn't know the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.09,0:20:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现尸体前 从昨晚到今早\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where were you last night, and earlier this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you found the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会外传的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is confidential, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在瞎驴子醉得不省人事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was passed out at the Blind Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.22,0:20:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里比看上去大得多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is bigger than it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,每间教室 办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checked every classroom, every office,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,走廊 厕所都查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}every hallway, and every bathroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲那厕所真该拿危险工作补贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I deserve hazard pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有发现吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有电磁干扰 没有巫术袋 没有硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}No EMF, no hex bags, no sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.85,0:21:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只发现几个老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I found were a couple of teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在休息室里亲热\N{\fnArial\fs30}making out in the break room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的发现也比我多 一个目击者都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got more than I did. Not one witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.13,0:21:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那个管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but the custodian…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对有点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's definitely something up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…古古怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's…squirrelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,年度最佳老师被贴在旗杆上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, teacher of the year gets run up a flagpole,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没人了解情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nobody knows squat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.34,0:21:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你跟菲尔普斯老师关系很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you were tight with Mr. Phelps.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.87,0:21:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得我很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought I was super-smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他劝我放弃足球 加入数学队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said I should ditch soccer and join the math team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的确很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are super-smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.97,0:21:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定遭了很大的罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he must have gone through…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人该死得那么惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody should die like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人就是那么变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到苏福尔斯附近还真会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never thought we'd have an actual psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这样的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}here in Sioux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.09,0:21:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上有很多可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are awful things out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:21:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.46,0:22:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不一直是现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't always this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我照着镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I look at myself in the mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.12,0:22:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,会想 「那是我吗」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm like, "That's me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.25,0:22:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你说过 你不得不逃家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you said you had to run away from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪收留了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody took you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.66,0:22:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前做过很坏的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done some really bad things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.71,0:22:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我要对你做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any idea what I'm about to do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.02,0:22:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.09,0:22:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.88,0:23:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have told you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.31,0:23:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都做过自己不耻的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's done stuff they're ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中学时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean there was this one kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺负过一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all tortured in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.44,0:23:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不愿去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.77,0:23:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.57,0:23:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你做了什么 我都不在乎 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is you did, I don't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想 也不用告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you never have to tell me anything if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪现场的纤维检验结果出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the results back on that fiber from the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.89,0:23:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么 - 石棉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - Asbestos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 石棉 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Asbestos? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.88,0:23:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 凶手防火吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So our killer's fire-retardant?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.51,0:23:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.67,0:23:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还猜不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not much yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.68,0:24:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 守卫维勒 他的不在场证明没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Weiler the janitor… his alibi checks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.98,0:24:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的社保号码不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, his social security number does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那原属于1988年死去的梅米·加西亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to Mamie Garcia, who died in 1988.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,维勒几个月前才入职\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Weiler started at Marshall a few months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪案就是那时开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the disappearances started…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.05,0:24:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我早说有问题的那些失踪案\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ones I said were supernatural in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.93,0:24:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们知道 你一直在提这茬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we know. You keep reminding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.93,0:24:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们需要再跟这位维勒先生谈谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we need to talk to this Mr. Weiler again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.80,0:24:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我在数据库里查下他的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm gonna run his I.D. photo through the database.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.52,0:24:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.91,0:24:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有套联调局西装 我可以扮成新学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a Fed suit, and I can be your new agent trainee.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.36,0:24:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等一下 匡提科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on there, Quantico.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.05,0:24:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我半小时后还有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are leaving in a half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去登记 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The registrar… remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.84,0:24:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,改天再去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reschedule it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.70,0:24:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,又改期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.71,0:24:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚得去求他让你重新入学\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going to beg him to let you re-enroll tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.46,0:24:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个凶手在逍遥法外呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}When there's a killer out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.77,0:25:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得好傻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like a total asshat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.65,0:25:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会穿成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who dresses like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.08,0:25:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人犯去见法官时穿礼服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there is a reason why murderers put on monkey suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.29,0:25:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they go in front of a judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.49,0:25:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.95,0:25:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直觉得你是比较漂亮的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought you were the pretty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.60,0:25:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,假地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a fake address.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.45,0:25:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死这哥们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm loving this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.25,0:26:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.96,0:26:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 赶快…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you need…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.99,0:26:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.04,0:26:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.84,0:26:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.51,0:26:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Jody?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.89,0:26:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.42,0:26:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去检查房内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.87,0:26:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.03,0:26:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.66,0:26:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是克莱尔的刀子 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Claire's knife. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.14,0:26:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么 它趁她们离开时埋伏了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever it was, it was lying in wait for them when they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.53,0:27:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是努恩探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Agent Noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.02,0:27:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没看到治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I have not seen the sheriff, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.99,0:27:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很愿意转达给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be happy to pass on the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.22,0:27:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正跟我搭档在一起 你有什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just here with my partner. Uh, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.40,0:27:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们确定了管理员的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}They identified the custodian.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.67,0:27:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.17,0:27:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德·毕桑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard Beesom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.42,0:27:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,内布拉斯加州奥尼尔市的一个卡车司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a trucker out of O'Neill, Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.91,0:27:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经失踪三年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been missing for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.15,0:27:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.23,0:27:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的家人被发现失血而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}His family was found exsanguinated…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.51,0:27:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喉咙被撕裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}throats ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.43,0:27:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是吸血鬼 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a vampire? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.69,0:27:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥尼尔 那不是艾莉克斯的家乡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'Neill… isn't that where Alex was from?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.24,0:27:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年她的巢穴所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where her nest was?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.38,0:27:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么毕桑是艾莉克斯之前巢穴的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, Beesom was part of Alex's old nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.26,0:27:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来找艾莉克斯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came here looking for Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.32,0:27:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却撞见了乔迪和克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then found Jody and Claire instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.01,0:27:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 还是有哪里不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Something still doesn't sit right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.99,0:27:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去提醒艾莉克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to warn Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.45,0:27:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你去接她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right, you pick her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.49,0:27:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去查一下毕桑的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go check Beesom's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.48,0:27:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里肯定有线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's bound to be something there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.20,0:27:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪 我去接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where are you? I'm coming to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.08,0:28:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在湖街的50代餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at 50's on lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.76,0:28:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 乖乖等我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sit tight till I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.88,0:28:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 千万不要一个人乱走 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do not go off by yourself. - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.31,0:28:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们学校的管理员是个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The custodian at your school… he's a vamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.29,0:28:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.72,0:28:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我五分钟内赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. I'll be there in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.85,0:28:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.07,0:28:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.30,0:28:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.15,0:28:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.79,0:28:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.80,0:28:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得马上离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get away from me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.11,0:28:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我留这儿就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.66,0:28:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.91,0:29:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.36,0:29:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.65,0:29:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我刚刚找到一张学校的旧地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, listen, I just found an old school map.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有栋建筑原本是个游泳池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there's a building that used to be the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.32,0:29:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为石棉问题而被校方关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}They closed it down because it had asbestos.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.26,0:29:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕桑肯定是把她们带去那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That has to be where Beesom took them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我距离那里就15分钟车程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 15 minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.98,0:29:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 是在学校最东面 蒙罗对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, uh, it's at the east end of the school across Menlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.67,0:29:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这就赶过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.00,0:30:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是那些失踪者的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the bodies that went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.15,0:30:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是点外卖而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little take-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.67,0:30:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着收垃圾日呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for trash day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.17,0:30:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.61,0:30:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么带我们来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.65,0:30:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.46,0:30:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.77,0:30:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.16,0:31:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的整个人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.27,0:31:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人重聚感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}How's this for a family reunion, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.93,0:31:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来也该邀请我家人的 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have invited my own, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.81,0:31:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们几年前死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they died a couple years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.02,0:31:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么死的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.77,0:31:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认出我是谁了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You figured out who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.67,0:31:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.73,0:31:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夺走了我的生命 现在居然不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you took my life, and you don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.29,0:31:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年前 内布拉斯加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years ago. Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.45,0:31:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个酒吧外 有个人渣想带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sleazebag was taking you home outside of a bar,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.53,0:31:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他赶跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I chased him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.72,0:32:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是那么年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, see, you were so young,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.37,0:32:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看出你一点都不想跟那个人走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I could see you didn't want anything to do with the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.40,0:32:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是有皮条客逼你卖淫呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I- I- I thought maybe some pimp was working you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.09,0:32:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了你几张二十美元 说会送你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you a few $20s and told you I would drive you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.55,0:32:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.80,0:32:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.51,0:32:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得当时一路上你一言未发吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember how you didn't say a word all the way there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.54,0:32:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.12,0:32:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they came.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.41,0:32:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.11,0:32:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.32,0:32:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群饥渴的吸血鬼猛扑向我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole starving pack tore into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.49,0:32:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们生生吸干了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They drank me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.35,0:33:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们转化了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.34,0:33:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰她 她当时别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her alone! She had no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.71,0:33:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时真正好玩的故事上演了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is when the real fun began.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.49,0:33:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为当我回到家想把这件事告诉我妻子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I went home to tell my wife what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.82,0:33:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我全身都沾满了自己的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, see, I was covered in blood… my own blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.16,0:33:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我变得疯狂 饥渴无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}which made me crazy, starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.39,0:33:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost control.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.07,0:33:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将她开肠破肚 还有我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gutted her…And my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.57,0:33:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.03,0:33:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们逼我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They… they made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.21,0:33:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全可以让我留在酒吧外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have left me outside that bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.33,0:33:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时是想帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.66,0:33:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.20,0:33:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能让我支撑下去的动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, the only thing that kept me going.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.61,0:33:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我知道总有一天我会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the knowledge that I would find you one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.90,0:33:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你血债血偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I would make you pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.78,0:33:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查跟踪你好几个月了 艾莉克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Rich was tracking you for months, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在监视你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's… he's been watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.54,0:33:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.84,0:34:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来是想直接把你杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was just gonna kill you outright,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.27,0:34:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你当时那么可怜 孤单一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, of course, you just were so miserable and alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.48,0:34:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了你岂不是便宜了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would have been a mercy killing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.41,0:34:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想先让你觉得幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to be happy first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.53,0:34:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你拥有珍视之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to have something precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.83,0:34:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再从你身边夺走它\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that I could take it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.35,0:34:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他转化了学校最受欢迎的男孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…He turned the most popular kid in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.98,0:34:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来找你 我先让你快乐起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sent me after you… I'd build you up…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.13,0:34:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就一步步击溃你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'd chop you right down piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.70,0:34:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要夺走你的老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd take your teacher…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.96,0:34:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的恋人 你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boyfriend, your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.69,0:34:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把你喂给我巢穴的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'll feed you to my nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都是骗我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing? None of it was real?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.70,0:34:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 艾莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.01,0:34:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a complete freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.10,0:34:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怒气冲冲地在学校里独来独往\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you were an angry loner creeping around the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.65,0:34:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着风衣 像个黑手党似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like some kind of trench coat mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.28,0:34:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着下地狱吧 你这变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna burn in hell, you sociopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.71,0:35:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不跟你这样的姑娘约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never date someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.05,0:35:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事你不许掺和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mess with this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.65,0:35:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利脾气还挺坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry's got a real mean streak, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.67,0:35:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不肯简单杀了菲尔普斯老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this one couldn't just kill Mr. Phelps.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.41,0:35:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还非要把他挂在旗杆上供全校师生瞻仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had to run him up a flagpole for the whole school to salute.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.73,0:35:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看见他了是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she saw him, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.77,0:35:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你引来了不少警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought a lot of cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.68,0:35:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但亨利还年轻 他会吸取教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Henry's young. He'll learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.15,0:35:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.52,0:35:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们知道我们在这儿 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They know we're here! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些联调局的 他们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those FBI… they're hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.64,0:35:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道你们杀了菲尔普斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know that you killed Phelps.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.93,0:35:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们杀了艾莉克斯巢穴的人 问她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they killed Alex's entire nest! Just ask her!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.57,0:35:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的 他们马上就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… it's true. They're coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.33,0:35:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.60,0:35:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 杀戮和逃亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, the killing and running all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.09,0:35:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.52,0:36:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你造成的 你给我们带来了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this! You did this to all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.09,0:36:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你爱的人一个个死去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna watch everyone you love die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.04,0:36:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你情报有误 死猪头 艾莉克斯讨厌我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your Intel, you pig! Alex hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.74,0:36:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I- I- I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.93,0:36:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过他们 我可以做你的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them go, and I'll lure for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.25,0:36:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我很擅长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how good I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.17,0:36:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮整个巢穴存活了八年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept a whole nest alive for eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.41,0:36:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有猎物时 你们可以喝我的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… and you can feed on me when the hunting goes dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.34,0:36:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会有狩猎无果的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it goes dry. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.23,0:36:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我会考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I might take you up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.45,0:36:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.02,0:36:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.33,0:37:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.84,0:37:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.79,0:37:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会来救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's gonna save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.02,0:37:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喝他们的血了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you drink their blood? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.67,0:38:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.37,0:38:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.24,0:38:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be the leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.86,0:38:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要拄拐了 - 我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna need bionics. - Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.11,0:38:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他随你处置\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.76,0:38:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道就抓住机会和你啪啪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have tapped that when I had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.53,0:38:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你的春梦去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep dreaming about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.53,0:38:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是培根烤糊的味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Yeah, I thought I smelled burning bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.23,0:38:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们俩做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two cooked?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.26,0:38:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.60,0:38:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,薄煎饼可能有点生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pancakes might be a little raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:39:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想为你做点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to do something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.12,0:39:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别这么看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stop looking at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.29,0:39:08.65,Title,0,0,0,0,,我感觉自己像小蒂姆（出自狄更斯《圣诞颂歌》）\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like tiny Tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.94,0:39:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉他伤害了你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry he hurt you… both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.32,0:39:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.05,0:39:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三个都完好无损 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in three whole pieces, more or less. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.37,0:39:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.44,0:39:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他差点因为我做的事 杀死你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He almost killed you for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.81,0:39:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那些吸血鬼干的 你那时只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for what those vamps did. You were a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.43,0:39:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能按他们说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to do whatever they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.41,0:39:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.89,0:39:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甘愿为我们放弃生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…You were ready to give up your life for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.46,0:39:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很善良了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.02,0:39:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是家庭的可怕之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what's scary about family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.43,0:39:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你有很多害怕失去的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives you so much to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.24,0:39:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.24,0:39:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我拥有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.63,0:39:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该看到乔迪解决那个吸血鬼的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have seen Jody take out that vamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.12,0:39:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她愿意为我挡子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would have taken a bullet for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.68,0:40:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你会不给她找那么多麻烦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean you're gonna make her life less hellish?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.47,0:40:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我郑重发誓不会像傻瓜一样猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I solemnly swear not to hunt like a dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.29,0:40:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪说她会教我搜寻线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody said that she's gonna teach me to vet leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.98,0:40:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,教我如何调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}and teach me how to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.79,0:40:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她觉得我会把自己害死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She think I'm gonna get myself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.56,0:40:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.24,0:40:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Ahh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.13,0:40:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我拿了肋排 两桶沙司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we got ribs and, uh, two tubs of sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.80,0:40:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不许吃我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're not touching mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.92,0:40:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好诶 - 昨晚做的晚饭 但没能吃上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Made them for dinner last night, but didn't get to eat it,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.40,0:40:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为被绑架了什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what with the multiple kidnappings and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.32,0:40:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.03,0:40:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.96,0:40:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.22,0:40:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 周一上学去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. School on Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.71,0:40:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去参加生物测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna go take a bio quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.05,0:40:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装你没有差点被杀死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pretend like you didn't almost get slaughtered?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.30,0:40:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不会放弃猎魔 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not giving up hunting, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.52,0:40:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.88,0:40:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯 也许还会有吸血鬼来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, other vamps may come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.49,0:40:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我会做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. And I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.12,0:41:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我的生活回归正轨 我也许会继续前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I get my life together, I might be moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.10,0:41:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯 你不用为了保护我们而离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, you don't have to leave to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.32,0:41:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not why.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.52,0:41:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想面对你们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be around what you all are doing…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.79,0:41:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你们猎杀的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the things you're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.61,0:41:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要一对二了 你不会有事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be all right now that you're outnumbered again?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.47,0:41:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要大家都戴避孕套 我们就没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, as long as everyone wears a condom, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.65,0:41:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话该做成车尾贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that bumper sticker.
